ximity sensor—the oil will bubble "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["violently when an Aswang is nearby."]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"Page #2"]},{"code":105,"indent":1,"parameters":[2,false]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["Entry Log #044: The Tree Demon (Kapre)"]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["Observation: A towering, muscular, 10-foot-tall "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["humanoid with dark, hairy skin. They reside in massive "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["trees like Balete, Mango, or Acacia. Mostly non-lethal "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["but highly disruptive, they enjoy playing tricks on "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["travelers, causing people to get hopelessly lost in "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["circles. Identifiable by the distinct smell of burning "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["tobacco and glowing red eyes in the canopy."]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":[""]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["Key Weakness: Turning Clothes Inside-Out & Their "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["Golden Stone. If trapped in their localized spatial "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["loop, take off your shirt/jacket and put it back on "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["inside-out; this instantly breaks their illusion. "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["For permanent compliance, steal their bato "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["(a glowing white or golden stone they sometimes "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["leave on the ground while smoking). "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["Whoever holds the stone holds absolute command "]},{"code":405,"indent":1,"parameters":["over that Kapre."]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":0,"parameters":[2,"Page #3"]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":0,"parameters":[3,"Page #4"]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"pa